# Mimeoplasm exiles Grizzly Bears as it enters, then Bot2's Unsummon returns it to Bot1's hand. Recast, it is a new
# object (CR 400.7) that exiles Llanowar Elves as it enters: its copy ability reads every card this object exiled, however
# it exiled it (the owner's ruling, jschibel, 2026-11-24), but the Bears was exiled by the Mimeoplasm that left, so it is
# no legal target - only the Elves is.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Entomb
Entomb
Mimeoplasm, Revered One
Swamp x10
Grizzly Bears
Llanowar Elves

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Unsummon
Island x4
Island x20

